{"id":"extraordinario","lemma":"extraordinario","pos":"adj","rank":2416,"glosses":["extraordinary"],"ipa":"/eɡstɾaoɾdiˈnaɾjo/","forms":{"feminine":"extraordinaria","masculinePlural":"extraordinarios","femininePlural":"extraordinarias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-extraordinario.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es extraordinario.","en":"This is extraordinary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461170","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Fue una experiencia extraordinaria.","en":"It was a remarkable experience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516269","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"experience"},null]},{"text":"Nada extraordinario ocurrió en nuestro viaje.","en":"Nothing out of the ordinary happened on our trip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804058","words":[{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"voyage"}]},{"text":"Esta sopa está extraordinaria.","en":"This soup is extraordinary.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"soup"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"¿Por qué tengo que hacer horas extraordinarias?","en":"Why do I have to work overtime?","words":[null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"hour","l":"hora"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]}]}